# Machine-local Subaya project binding only. NOT the whole directory:
# .subaya/project.toml is the COMMITTED project file (devices/apps) and is
# maintained by Subaya's Git Sync worker — ignoring it would fight that.
.subaya/config.toml

# canon output — generated at build time from a pinned tag, never committed
gen/

# Browser-automation scratch (playwright-cli)
.playwright-cli/

# Baselines are intentionally committed; nothing to ignore there.

# Vendor documents — these live in the Subaya RAG corpus, not in the repo.
# The AXE5000 guide, MCP251863 datasheet, Agilex 5 config guide and Mailbox
# Client IP UG are all ingested and queryable via `suya rag`; a copy here would
# duplicate them and bloat the tree.
*.pdf
*.PDF
